@startuml
title COLORS Web Application - Class Diagram

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class User <<entity>> {
    - userId : int
    - firstName : string
    - lastName : string
    - login : string
    - password : string
}

class Color <<entity>> {
    - userId : int
    - name : string
}

class ColorApplication <<JavaScript>> {
    - userId : int
    - firstName : string
    - lastName : string

    + doLogin() : void
    + saveCookie() : void
    + readCookie() : void
    + doLogout() : void
    + addColor() : void
    + searchColor() : void
}

class LoginAPI <<PHP>> {
    + getRequestInfo() : JSON
    + authenticateUser() : User
    + returnWithInfo() : JSON
    + returnWithError() : JSON
}

class AddColorAPI <<PHP>> {
    + getRequestInfo() : JSON
    + addColor() : void
    + returnWithError() : JSON
}

class SearchColorsAPI <<PHP>> {
    + getRequestInfo() : JSON
    + searchColors() : List
    + returnWithInfo() : JSON
    + returnWithError() : JSON
}

class Database <<MySQL>> {
    + connect() : Connection
    + executeQuery() : ResultSet
    + close() : void
}

User "1" -- "0..*" Color : owns

ColorApplication ..> LoginAPI : sends login request
ColorApplication ..> AddColorAPI : sends add request
ColorApplication ..> SearchColorsAPI : sends search request

LoginAPI --> Database : queries Users
AddColorAPI --> Database : inserts into Colors
SearchColorsAPI --> Database : queries Colors

note right of User
  Represents a record
  in the Users table.
end note

note right of Color
  Represents a record
  in the Colors table.

  Each color is associated
  with a user ID.
end note

note bottom of ColorApplication
  Implemented in js/code.js.

  Browser cookie stores
  login session information.
end note

note bottom of Database
  Database connection is
  established through
  contacts.php.
end note

@enduml